OL,3,GNEWSANew ferry on hold until Douglas
OL,4,AHarbour dredged
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe purchase of a new vessel to replace
OL,7,Fthe Isle of Man's fast-craft ferry,
OL,8,FManannan, has been put on hold until
OL,9,Fdredging work is completed, the chief
OL,10,Fminister has said.
OL,12,FIt comes as the island's main ferry,
OL,13,FManxman, has been out of service since
OL,14,FJuly for repair work, while the back-up
OL,15,Fvessel, Ben-my-Chree, has also spent
OL,16,Fseveral days undergoing maintenance.
OL,18,FChief minister Chris Thomas, known as
OL,19,Fthe Ard-Shirveishagh in Manx, said
OL,20,Fthere had been "issues" with dredging
OL,21,Fat the harbour.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
