OL,3,GNEWSANew ferry on hold until Douglas
OL,4,AHarbour dredged
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said maintaining links to and from
OL,7,Fthe island was a government priority
OL,8,Fand that "the purchase of the new
OL,9,Fvessel is on pause until we deal with
OL,10,F[the dredging] issues".
